2906..2983 Comment "/// The loops commute (cubical\'s `comm-ΩS¹`): each composite is the spin of"
2984..3062 Comment "/// its winding by `sect`, the windings sum by `windHom`, and the sums commute"
3063..3138 Comment "/// by `plusComm`. Each lemma is read at its written result (#423), and the"
3139..3195 Comment "/// calls in the types stand as what they return (#426)."
